msgid "Gotify"
msgstr "Gotify"

msgid "Manage the Gotify push notification service. Apps, clients, and messages stay in the Gotify Web UI. Database and image paths are fixed by the package init script."
msgstr "管理 Gotify 推送通知服务。应用、客户端与消息仍在 Gotify Web UI 中处理。数据库与图片路径由软件包 init 脚本固定。"

